sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Client
    participant B as Service
    activate A
    A->>+B: Request
    B->>+B: Nested request
    B-->>-B: Nested response
    B-->>-A: Response
    deactivate A
    A->>B: Explicit request
    activate B
    Note right of B: Processing<br/>Several steps
    B-->>A: Explicit response
    deactivate B
    A->>A: After completion
